    {
      "position": {
        "col": 1,
        "sizex": 12,
        "row": 4,
        "sizey": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "displaySettings": {},
        "isSupportCustomProperty": false,
        "supportCustomProperty": false,
        "name": "Environment Health \u2014 Read First",
        "description": "Read first guide for this dashboard.",
        "theme": "newSolidDarkBlue",
        "interval": 15,
        "type": "text",
        "timescale": "day",
        "version": 2,
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.45;background:#0f172a;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#f9fafb;margin-bottom:4px;\">Environment Health</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af;margin-bottom:12px;\">Operational view of where risk is concentrated across resources, collectors, and websites.</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:10px;\"><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Questions this dashboard answers</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Where are alerts concentrated geographically or by type?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Which resources are dead or minimally monitored?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Are collectors healthy enough to trust the data?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Are websites failing?</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:34%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Recommended review flow</div>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Map + NOC</strong> \u2014 Find concentration</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Dead / minimal KPIs</strong> \u2014 Blind spots</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Collector alerts</strong> \u2014 Data pipeline</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Website dead count</strong> \u2014 Service checks</li></ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Where to go next</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Active alert triage \u2192 03</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Collector diagnostics \u2192 07</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Website detail \u2192 05</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Coverage / discovery \u2192 04</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Empty / zero: confirm tokens and LogicModules. Healthy zero critical alerts still warrants Warning and dead-resource checks.</div>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>"
      }
    },
